{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is Kill Love?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Love is a psychological horror that tells the story of Aki, a high school student suffering from schizophrenia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beta version of the game, you will be able to get to know Aki's school, talk to her classmates and face the beginning of distortions in her world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is based on solving puzzles and making decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters with hallucinations and rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story with multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doing homework, participating in school events and relationships with other characters.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978620?t=1761251069","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978620?t=1761251069","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978620/8b37136ece832ac45fb24f5391b59b4b087b04de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761251069","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978620/8b37136ece832ac45fb24f5391b59b4b087b04de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761251069","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes themes of mental health struggles and psychological tension. Some scenes may include anxiety, and emotional distress. Player discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Features and gameplay:</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978620/extras/e077b7381284014d2a60e20e6bbf7eae.avif?t=1761251069\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978620/extras_big/e077b7381284014d2a60e20e6bbf7eae.webp?t=1761251069 width=1560 height=653 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interaction with characters:\u00a0</strong>Chat with your classmates, but be careful, because monsters can chase you!</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A demo version of the game is in development.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978620/extras/cf66ffcd914d80c3273e84eecff1a09b.avif?t=1761251069\" width=1327 height=959 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978620/extras/9756fd18693d9396b393b5fd4a6a7759.avif?t=1761251069\" width=1056 height=648 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is Kill Love?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Love is a psychological horror that tells the story of Aki, a high school student suffering from schizophrenia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beta version of the game, you will be able to get to know Aki's school, talk to her classmates and face the beginning of distortions in her world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is based on solving puzzles and making decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters with hallucinations and rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story with multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doing homework, participating in school events and relationships with other characters.</p></li></ul>","developers":["ITau","DianaBuu"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978620/c712cc2d25d7522df4c023be49c8e223d391237b/header.jpg?t=1761251069","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3978620/157451695/890c0a4491c215758d5b2be07264c5913d5a0f64/1759675101/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761251067","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3978620/157451695/890c0a4491c215758d5b2be07264c5913d5a0f64/1759675101/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761251067","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3978620/157451695/890c0a4491c215758d5b2be07264c5913d5a0f64/1759675101/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761251067","id":257212573,"name":"Kill Love","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257212573/cb612f6dc533b3c6bb3afcb4d5d77622bd668879/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761251067"}],"name":"Kill Love","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 @ 2,80 GHz, AMD FX 8120 @ 3.1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GT 630 / 650m, AMD Radeon HD6570 or equivalent</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></l